I built the issue desk in `app.contract` (the view) and `app.ts` (the data module) in `/tmp/claude-0/runs/r15/desk9-contract-haiku-2`. `./check` is clean and all 30 visible tests pass in `./test`, using 3 of the 15 runs. Optimistic writes ride on Exact's overlay, and each write's reply carries a sequence number so a stale error never shows. I did not test the failure paths beyond the visible tests, and I was unsure how Exact's overlay behaves when a server answer lags behind a write, so I kept each write showing until a later answer reflects it.